### 5.2 菴懈･ｭ莠ｺ謇句牡蠖難ｼ・8繝ｻF9・・
豈弱ヵ繝ｬ繝ｼ繝莉･荳九ｒ螳溯｡鯉ｼ・
```gdscript
# EconGrid.update_construction(delta) 蜀・func _allocate_work_labor() -> Array:
    # 1. 蟒ｺ險ｭ荳ｭ繧ｵ繧､繝医ｒ縲茎tarted_at 蜿､縺・・阪〒繧ｽ繝ｼ繝茨ｼ井ｼ∫判譖ｸ ﾂｧ7.7・・    var sorted_sites: Array = construction_sites.values()
    sorted_sites.sort_custom(func(a, b): return a.started_at < b.started_at)

    # 2. 菴懈･ｭ莠ｺ謇九・繝ｼ繝ｫ = EconEconomy.get_work_labor()
    var pool: int = economy.get_work_labor()
    var active_sites: Array = []

    # 3. 蜷・し繧､繝医↓ required_work_labor 繧貞牡繧雁ｽ薙※
    #    驛ｨ蛻・ｨｼ蜒阪＠縺ｪ縺・ｼ井ｼ∫判譖ｸ ﾂｧ7.6・俄・ 荳崎ｶｳ縺励◆繧牙牡繧雁ｽ薙※螟ｱ謨暦ｼ亥●豁｢・・    for site in sorted_sites:
        if pool >= site.required_work_labor:
            pool -= site.required_work_labor
            active_sites.append(site)
        # else: 蛛懈ｭ｢・・rogress 謐ｮ縺育ｽｮ縺阪（s_under_construction 縺ｯtrue縺ｮ縺ｾ縺ｾ・・
    return active_sites
```

`active_sites` 縺ｮ縺ｿ `progress += delta / construction_time` 繧貞刈邂励☆繧九・
### 5.3 遞ｼ蜒堺ｺｺ謇句牡蠖難ｼ・8繝ｻF9・・
豈弱ヵ繝ｬ繝ｼ繝莉･荳九ｒ螳溯｡鯉ｼ医∪縺溘・蟒ｺ迚ｩ螳梧・譎・繧ｹ繝ｩ繧､繝繝ｼ螟画峩譎ゅ・蜀崎ｨ育ｮ暦ｼ会ｼ・
```gdscript
# EconBattle._allocate_operation_labor() 蜀・func _allocate_operation_labor() -> Array:
    # 1. 螳梧・貂医∩蟒ｺ迚ｩ繧貞━蜈磯・ｽ埼・↓繧ｽ繝ｼ繝茨ｼ井ｼ∫判譖ｸ ﾂｧ7.7・・    #    1: 鬟滓侭邉ｻ・・ILLAGE/DINER・・    #    2: 雉・ｺ千ｳｻ・・AWMILL/MINE/TRADE_POST・・    #    3: 蜈ｵ蜉帷ｳｻ・・ARRACKS・・    #    4: 貅雜ｳ蠎ｦ邉ｻ・・LAZA・・    #    5: 縺昴・莉厄ｼ・OUSE 遲峨・required_operation_labor=0 縺ｯ譛荳倶ｽ搾ｼ・    var sorted_buildings: Array = _get_buildings_by_priority()

    # 2. 遞ｼ蜒堺ｺｺ謇九・繝ｼ繝ｫ = EconEconomy.get_operation_labor()
    var pool: int = economy.get_operation_labor()
    var active_buildings: Array = []

    # 3. 驛ｨ蛻・ｨｼ蜒阪↑縺暦ｼ井ｼ∫判譖ｸ ﾂｧ7.6・・    for b in sorted_buildings:
        var req: int = _get_required_operation_labor(b.building_type)
        if pool >= req:
            pool -= req
            b.is_operating = true
            active_buildings.append(b)
        else:
            b.is_operating = false  # 蛛懈ｭ｢繝輔Λ繧ｰ

    return active_buildings
```

> 譌｢蟄・`EconBuilding._process_xxx` 蜀・〒 `if not is_operating: return` 縺ｮ繧ｬ繝ｼ繝峨ｒ霑ｽ蜉縺吶ｋ縺薙→縺ｧ蜉ｹ譫懃匱蜍輔ち繧､繝槭・繧貞●豁｢縺吶ｋ・域里蟄倥ち繧､繝槭・縺ｯ蜑埼ｲ縺輔○縺ｪ縺・ｼ晏・髢区凾縺ｫ縺昴・縺ｾ縺ｾ邯壹″縺九ｉ蜍輔￥・峨・
### 5.4 騾ｲ謐怜愛螳夲ｼ・6繝ｻF12・・
```gdscript
# EconGrid.update_construction(delta) 譛ｫ蟆ｾ
for panel_id in construction_sites.keys().duplicate():
    var site = construction_sites[panel_id]
    if site.construction_progress >= 1.0:
        # 蟒ｺ險ｭ螳御ｺ・        var btype = site.building_type
        var card_id = site.card_id
        var is_special = site.is_special

        construction_sites.erase(panel_id)
        spawn_building(panel_id, btype, site.required_operation_labor)

        # 繧ｫ繝ｼ繝牙屓蜿趣ｼ育鮪邨仙粋: deck_manager 縺ｮ繝｡繧ｽ繝・ラ邨檎罰・・        if is_special:
            deck_manager.exclude_card(card_id)  # 莠､謠帶園縺ｪ縺ｩ
        else:
            deck_manager.discard_card(card_id)

        LogManager.log_event({
            "type": "BUILDING_COMPLETED",
            "panel_id": [panel_id.x, panel_id.y],
            "building_type": btype,
        })
```

